 <p><a href={"/blog/" + (guide.slug.includes("product-data") ? "black-friday-ecommerce-seo-" : "black-friday-product-data-") + guide.lang}>{ar ? "الدليل المكمل: خطة الموسم وبيانات المنتجات" : "Companion guide: seasonal planning and product data"}</a></p>
